WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.384
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind insert text features.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.674
Word processor: creates and edits text documents. Bold: makes important words stand

00:00:11.674 --> 00:00:12.131
out.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:18.282
Alignment: positions text on the page. Clipboard: temporarily holds copied material.

00:00:18.282 --> 00:00:21.675
Spell check: helps find possible spelling mistakes.

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:27.723
Make a one-page paper example about your school or a Ghanaian festival. Include word

00:00:27.723 --> 00:00:31.429
processor, bold and alignment; present it clearly to a partner.
